{"seq":80,"slug":"memory-management-models","title":"内存管理模型","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 内存管理模型\n\n内存管理是编程语言设计中最根本的架构决策之一。它决定了程序的性能上限、可能出现的 bug 类别、以及语言本身的编程体验。从 C 的手动 malloc/free 到 Java 的分代垃圾回收，再到 Rust 的所有权系统，不同语言在「控制力」与「安全性」之间做出了截然不同的权衡。\n\n本 hub 系统性地剖析主流内存管理模型的设计原理、实现机制与工程实践。内容覆盖手动管理、追踪式 GC、引用计数、所有权模型、区域分配器等核心范式，并对比各语言的实际选择与调优策略。\n\n## 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界\n\n- **type-systems**：聚焦类型论与类型推断；本 hub 仅在线性/仿射类型与内存安全交叉时涉及类型系统\n- **rust-async-runtime**：关注 Rust 异步运行时的调度与 Future 机制；本 hub 限于 Rust 所有权/借用的内存语义\n- **concurrency-models**：讨论并发原语与同步机制；本 hub 仅涉及 GC 的并发实现（如并发标记、写屏障）对应用暂停的影响\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n1. **foundations** — 建立内存布局、栈/堆、安全性分类的共识基础\n2. **automatic-management** — 理解追踪 GC 与引用计数的算法原理与演进\n3. **ownership-models** — 掌握编译期内存管理的前沿范式（Rust、线性类型、区域分配）\n4. **practice** — 将理论映射到工程决策：GC 调优、手动 vs 托管权衡、跨语言对比\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 熟悉至少一门系统语言（C/C++/Rust/Go）的基本内存操作\n- 理解进程地址空间的基本概念（代码段、数据段、栈、堆）\n- 了解指针/引用的语义差异\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"内存管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-layout-lifecycle","title":"内存布局与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/foundations/memory-layout-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stack-vs-heap","title":"栈与堆的深度对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/foundations/stack-vs-heap"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-safety-classes","title":"内存安全性分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/foundations/memory-safety-classes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"automatic-management","title":"自动内存管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tracing-gc-algorithms","title":"追踪式垃圾回收算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/tracing-gc-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reference-counting","title":"引用计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/reference-counting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"generational-concurrent-gc","title":"分代与并发垃圾回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/generational-concurrent-gc"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ownership-models","title":"所有权与区域模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/ownership-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rust-ownership-borrowing","title":"Rust 所有权与借用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/ownership-models/rust-ownership-borrowing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-affine-types","title":"线性类型与仿射类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/ownership-models/linear-affine-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"arena-pool-allocators","title":"Arena 与池分配器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/ownership-models/arena-pool-allocators"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gc-tuning-profiling","title":"GC 调优与性能分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/practice/gc-tuning-profiling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"manual-vs-managed-tradeoffs","title":"手动与托管内存管理的权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/practice/manual-vs-managed-tradeoffs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-memory-comparison","title":"跨语言内存模型对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/practice/language-memory-comparison"}]}]}